  "title": "Sinclair Announces Retirement of Chief Compliance Officer Jeff Lewis - Sinclair, Inc",
  "summary": "HUNT VALLEY, Md. – April 27, 2026 – Sinclair, Inc. today announced that Jeffrey Lewis, Chief Compliance Officer, will retire from the Company effective May 4, 2026. Since joining Sinclair in 2021, Lewis has overseen the Company&apos;s compliance programs and regulatory strategy, helping ensure alignment with evolving industry standards and requirements, overseeing key regulatory areas...",
